WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.011 --> 00:00:01.750
- Well, Mother's Day is around the corner,

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.200
so what are you getting your mom?

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.170
Don't let her down.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:07.270
- Well, you know, it used
to be when I was younger,

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:08.630
anything made her happy.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:10.700
I could pick dandelions out of the yard.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.230
I could bake her something.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:15.480
I could make her pancakes
but now all she wants

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.659
is celebrity male attention.

00:00:17.659 --> 00:00:18.650
(audience giggling)
- What?

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:19.900
- [Ron] That's all she
cares about because--

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.040
- What does that mean?

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.316
- I took her to meet Blake
Shelton at "The Voice"

00:00:23.316 --> 00:00:24.180
one year.
- [Kelly] Oh.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:26.330
- And since then--
- [Kelly] Since then she gave

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:27.260
up celebrities?

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.970
- She gave up regular man.
(laughing)

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:31.590
She gave, all she wants is celebrities.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:32.914
All she will talk about it, that's all.

00:00:32.914 --> 00:00:35.852
She's touched Justin Timberlake.

00:00:35.852 --> 00:00:37.383
- She's touched.
(laughing)

00:00:37.383 --> 00:00:40.150
- His security tried to stop her.

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:42.300
They could not, they could not.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.520
And right now her big,
the gift she wants me

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.720
to find a way to get LeBron James for her.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.210
So that's partially--

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.250
- I love your mother right now.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.020
The three men you just mentioned

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:54.368
couldn't be more different from the other.

00:00:54.368 --> 00:00:56.470
- No, she says that she gets older,

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:58.860
you know, she's just open,
she's like Baskin Robbins.

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:00.311
Give me a little spoon for every flavor.

00:01:00.311 --> 00:01:01.620
(laughing)

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.770
- She wants to try
every flavor, I love it.

